{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lunch is ready! Now how will I fit it into my lunch box?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>A Slice of Lunch</strong> your goal is to pack your whole meal into your lunchbox. However, with limited slices, wacky shaped foods, and a modest lunchbox, its harder than it looks. From neatly arranging onigiri to slicing up macaroni, this tasty puzzle game will really test your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535290/extras/1c35be07366a59e7a03aff1b6f35656b.poster.avif?t=1761793030\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535290/extras/1c35be07366a59e7a03aff1b6f35656b.webm?t=1761793030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535290/extras/1c35be07366a59e7a03aff1b6f35656b.mp4?t=1761793030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different cuisines and uniquely shaped foods,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slices are limited, so make every slice count!,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate food to neatly fit them into the perfect space</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535290/extras/4963633e1265391f245cfc181708a90c.poster.avif?t=1761793030\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535290/extras/4963633e1265391f245cfc181708a90c.webm?t=1761793030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535290/extras/4963633e1265391f245cfc181708a90c.mp4?t=1761793030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your lunch is nicely packed and snap the lid on.<i> <strong>Click</strong></i><strong>!</strong> You're lunch is ready to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535290/extras/29f03a677268df4fef4442a6c789403f.poster.avif?t=1761793030\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535290/extras/29f03a677268df4fef4442a6c789403f.webm?t=1761793030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535290/extras/29f03a677268df4fef4442a6c789403f.mp4?t=1761793030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4b Grab food to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2a Slice Food</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 Rotate Food</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535290?t=1761793030","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535290/1441fd45209c3e4deb7f0e77becf067a21b5638f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761793030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535290/e1a19e36bc402e2a870fc78a0e66e449e9076e8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761793030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535290/e1a19e36bc402e2a870fc78a0e66e449e9076e8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761793030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":40